								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I posted in this thread then didn&#039;t notice that he applied to the guild I&#039;m in and after awhile got in. &nbsp;I pay attention GOOD. &nbsp; ;D<br />
