	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7769"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=35" title="View the profile of Medsolo">Medsolo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Leader<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=35"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:rallsolo@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=665.msg7769#msg7769"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=665.msg7769#msg7769">Re:Einalem /Breneaur</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #16 on:</b> May 06, 2004, 02:57:20 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Howdy. &nbsp;Just thought I would give everyone an update on this toon. &nbsp;He has a low level toon named Wolfpets. &nbsp;He was invited into the Fizzle Fiends and was a decent addition to the guild. &nbsp;He told me his account had been hacked and his 65 FoT flagged cleric was deleted, so he was in the process of /petitioning to get him back. &nbsp;Care to guess what the cleric&#039;s name was?<br /><br />Anyway, he got Breneaur back with no loss of level and with his epic back. &nbsp;I had no idea about what was going on until Azlani sent me a tell. &nbsp;Azlani was a member of the Fiends many moons ago and we have many mutual friends. &nbsp;He gave me the lowdown and told me he didn&#039;t care what action I took, but that the Fiends should know who we had in the guild.<br /><br />I discussed it with the rest of the guild officers and we came to the unanimous decision that we didn&#039;t want someone with that kind of reputation in the guild. &nbsp;He has been removed. &nbsp;I enjoyed playing with him on the several occasions I grouped with him, and he seemed like a decent enough guy. &nbsp;It is a shame.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
